[statement]
Removals that wait for nothing go in the order of the installed database,
each followed at once by what waited for it alone: `a` frees `lib`, which
goes before `x`.

[repository]
P:b
V:1

[installed]
P:a
V:1
D:lib

P:x
V:1

P:lib
V:1

[request]
b

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove a 1
remove lib 1
remove x 1
install b 1
